<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Profile - Nguyễn Văn A</title>
<style>
  * {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
  }

  body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .profile-card {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    max-width: 400px;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .profile-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
  }

  .cover {
    height: 120px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
    position: relative;
  }

  .avatar {
    width: 120px;
    height: 120px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 5px solid #fff;
    object-fit: cover;
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -60px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: #ddd;
  }

  .profile-info {
    padding: 70px 30px 30px;
  }

  .profile-info h1 {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }

  .profile-info .title {
    color: #764ba2;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .profile-info .bio {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .stats {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .stat h3 {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: #333;
  }

  .stat p {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #999;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .btn {
    padding: 10px 25px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent;
    color: #764ba2;
    border: 2px solid #764ba2;
  }

  .btn-outline:hover {
    background: #764ba2;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .socials {
    margin-top: 20px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 15px;
  }

  .socials a {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #f0f0f0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #764ba2;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 18px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .socials a:hover {
    background: #764ba2;
    color: #fff;
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="profile-card">
    <div class="cover">
      <img 
        class="avatar" 
        src="https://i.pravatar.cc/300?img=12" 
        alt="Avatar"
      >
    </div>

    <div class="profile-info">
      <h1>Nguyễn Văn A</h1>
      <p class="title">Full-Stack Developer</p>
      <p class="bio">
        Đam mê lập trình và xây dựng những sản phẩm tuyệt vời. 
        Yêu thích HTML, CSS, JavaScript và Node.js.
      </p>

      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <h3>120</h3>
          <p>Bài viết</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <h3>1.5K</h3>
          <p>Followers</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <h3>350</h3>
          <p>Following</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="buttons">
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Theo dõi</a>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline">Nhắn tin</a>
      </div>

      <div class="socials">
        <a href="#" title="Facebook">f</a>
        <a href="#" title="GitHub">🐙</a>
        <a href="#" title="Twitter">🐦</a>
        <a href="#" title="LinkedIn">in</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
